{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a6276c3034e0624d3e1f0b2fa438a02f6fe67a89cde36d3535cfd42dbcb82be4", "ja": "（今日は、39プロジェクトのアイドルを探すため、\nミスコンで有名な大学の学園祭にやってきた）", "zh": "（今天，为了寻找39PROJECT的偶像，\n我来到以校园选美闻名的某大学学园祭。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a46d98251db3eb454096e7de55443414ed8bc7c15078f9ca161ceab10efa9b98", "ja": "（ミスコンの出場者の中に、\nアイドル候補がいるといいんだが……）", "zh": "（希望能在校园选美的参赛者中\n发现可能的偶像人选……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "0a4ccd6483ff802858c5c3e6479a3984c6342cdada2917c1dc08c33bb891ef28", "ja": "お～っほっほっほっ！", "zh": "哦～呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1003_audience", "source_sha256": "b4b49bd4af5d8c62d72e2f8d481147aa7e80e7c402a6e2d6682798ef05df8ed1", "ja": "きゃあああああ～！\n千鶴さん、ステキ～！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊啊～！\n千鹤同学好美～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "e343240873c33e595dde3e71cb9ea0616e9eaedd7e38b29a84d283e0f522f1d8", "ja": "頑張ってくださ～い！！", "zh": "加油～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8aaaebe79670bb7a9849164681e5f9ffa1bb76fa9ffd0307448753bd1bbcb28c", "ja": "（な、なんだ、この歓声は？\nこんなに注目を浴びてる出場者とはいったい……）", "zh": "（欢、欢呼声怎么这么热烈？\n如此受欢迎的参赛者究竟是何方神圣……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "be192bdaeb6b6a5d6f4c21a042f1ca0e32355e0a99a78907481253f38468535f", "ja": "ふふっ。\nみなさま、応援ありがとうございます。", "zh": "呵呵。\n各位同学，谢谢你们的声援。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "9a15859b8b67710aee25caff05796267ee8d5356b74bc47a21d71ea48e6f25ee", "ja": "わたくし二階堂千鶴は、セレブの名にかけて、\nミスコンテストで優勝することを誓いますわ！", "zh": "本小姐，二阶堂千鹤，赌上名流之名，\n发誓将会赢得选美冠军！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "fa656fc0288756edda360b4ac37d3702b8ffdb88456d9bf0a8e8f3f6f97157fe", "ja": "ですので、どうかみなさま！\nこの後も応援のほど、よろしくお願いいたしますわ！", "zh": "因此，各位同学！\n接下来也请务必继续声援本小姐了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1009_audience", "source_sha256": "d879f355605ef90703e4475dd838606af8a121050feb943ccb8c8eebe061e212", "ja": "わあああああー！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "77b08365ca3b1a2a06eb7632b1e8e41802e0346a87febff25d8eb6e0840470be", "ja": "（すごいオーラ、そしてカリスマ性だ。あれほどの\n逸材がミスコンに出場してたなんて……！）", "zh": "（好强大的气场和魅力。\n没想到有这么厉害的人才参加这场选美……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "1f4090a6b39359b4d5b10ccb7b184515cdc27ef00faef8cdb7ec5c675e8132e3", "ja": "みなさま、ありがとうございます！\nお～ほっほっほ…ゴホッ、ケホッ！", "zh": "谢谢各位的支持！\n哦～呵呵呵……咳咳、咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "265580deeca3a8de7683ba5f177979570a04ff184d9a1275983d570da156bc89", "ja": "（今年のミスコン優勝者は、二階堂千鶴。\nさっきの、あの彼女に決まった）", "zh": "（今年的校园选美冠军是二阶堂千鹤，\n就是刚才那个女生。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e3f18f9fedfd9afced8fc30be7431705e2625dda2868acb81e371239d6974089", "ja": "（あれほどの逸材だ。よその事務所に\n取られる前に、早く声をかけないと……！）", "zh": "（那么厉害的人才，我要赶在其他事务所之前，\n快去挖角她……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "f04061b42e833d55eb05fa473c7d88c6894eedc47c33a8edd5fb5e59cf991021", "ja": "ふぅ……。\n宣言通り優勝できて、ひと安心ですわね。", "zh": "呼……\n依照当初的宣言成功获胜，可以放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1015_friend1", "source_sha256": "0e65324cb7b84fe7f6bc747a3dbf86408b6230a6a0ba7f4c71cabefbc6cba500", "ja": "さすがは千鶴さんね！　並み居るライバルを\n押しのけて、ぶっちぎりの優勝……。", "zh": "不愧是千鹤！击退其他竞争对手，\n独占鳌头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1016_friend2", "source_sha256": "25cb4d9e0958e9fe293e8eb3b3c55a66a1653f0706ab8f96a1c28982445adfd6", "ja": "そりゃあ、千鶴さんだもの。\n推薦した私達も鼻が高いわ！", "zh": "人家可是千鹤啊。\n我们身为推荐人也觉得很骄傲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "22ba2d19a1a7cecac3aa917dc441e5faf6f10a45c5503aa27f79a26de95aa899", "ja": "ふふ、みなさまの期待に応えられたようで\n何よりですわ。", "zh": "呵呵，能够不负各位的期望，\n这样就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "d640eae65a05eb06a4d0d7441d09ed6fe5ef633bb92ba075a5677fa5d1b334fd", "ja": "ま、まあ、わたくしにしてみれば当然ですけれど！\nお～っほっほ……！", "zh": "不、不过呢，对本小姐来说这是理所当然的呀！\n哦～呵呵……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1019_p", "source_sha256": "77827539d623fb86037bd06613989653317cb086c408fdb148be0aa8aa25183f", "ja": "あの、すみません！", "zh": "那个，不好意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "1f3a02a33f837b92c73ba002acf4f1ce0ccc1e93d9e28e03e4c72f6968b48887", "ja": "ゴホッ。あら、貴方は……？", "zh": "咳咳。哎呀？请问你是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_1021", "source_sha256": "7b4c8780449452e13994ae8022166dfef29c57f4ca9c5e3663af7c94418bc3fc", "ja": "全力で名刺を取り出す", "zh": "用力拿出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "96bba37744716304d16b2ef46cfa632baf0876e9caa943c4feb377978796b2eb", "ja": "はじめまして！　俺は765プロというアイドル事務所\nで、プロデューサーをやっている者です。", "zh": "你好！我是一间叫做765艺能的\n偶像事务所的制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2001_038chz", "source_sha256": "60ec5b31485b2c6b09122f17c3173e9662265452f66015f9bd594297d120748c", "ja": "アイドル……？\nええと、なんのお話しかしら？", "zh": "偶像……？\n那么，请问有何贵干？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "246a17bc17d717ee81cffdaa3640144e6f13ef7f1162985788709e56621f602e", "ja": "さっきのコンテスト、見てました。\nぜひ、あなたをスカウトしたいんです！", "zh": "我看了刚才的选美比赛。\n希望你务必和本事务所签约！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2003_038chz", "source_sha256": "76d2806fb5232441d2387d14e07e52da14004261e415cb8ba1970c298bb75c60", "ja": "スカウト！？\nわ、わたくしを？", "zh": "签约！？\n本、本小姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "2bac70dde01e2875bf95b26253a189421c30842098455b14f501c39deb8f76ec", "ja": "はい！　どうか、うちの事務所の、\nアイドルになってもらえませんか？", "zh": "是的！不知道你有没有意愿\n成为本事务所的偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2005_038chz", "source_sha256": "abdf54126fd27fdb6e8f4f0ab6f8ea50bb4bd2b50b94ed742361090adcfffab1", "ja": "お、お待ちくださいな。\n急にそんなことを言われましても……。", "zh": "请、请你稍等一下。\n你太过突然了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2006_friend1", "source_sha256": "f70bfb8f5cc96c14638ec19b722305a9453285903d14ce6e0c50b7f55a16d996", "ja": "うわぁ、スカウトだって！\nすごい……！", "zh": "哇～是星探要签约耶！\n好厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2007_038chz", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2008_friend2", "source_sha256": "cdf92486578e299e38104c10ce4a8009fb2b3b3e29f950d6739f575d06562f12", "ja": "アイドルにスカウトされるなんて、さすが千鶴さん！\nセレブでアイドル……もうカンペキだよ！", "zh": "居然被偶像星探看上，不愧是千鹤！\n既是名流又是偶像……根本完美了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2009_038chz", "source_sha256": "b97bff76c5fc0e8907965904841d0c8bb47f4f01d7ec38050d4254a9280e90ec", "ja": "えっと、あの……。あ、アイドル……でしたか？\nそれは一体、どんなことをするのでしょう？", "zh": "不好意思，那个……你、你说偶像……是吗？\n请问偶像究竟是做什么的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "a7700c05a89035db3ef9ec1c811156b6178cfb7e55e746c01087bc61cb4a4237", "ja": "そうですね。歌を歌ったり、ダンスをしたり\n……あとはモデルや、演技の仕事もあります。", "zh": "这个嘛，唱歌、跳舞……\n也有担任模特儿或演员的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2011_friend1", "source_sha256": "0951fc9a11165f10f808d7ab38863ace8bf4588bd1bb75dac4319911e32db702", "ja": "それってもう、カンペキに芸能人ってことだよね。\nいいな～憧れちゃうな～。", "zh": "这样完全就是艺人了对吧？\n好好哦～真令人羡慕～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2012_friend2", "source_sha256": "b3a4f09690c6372d349734c897458736bb4f74e7c96c96db1d07eec980eff5cb", "ja": "セレブなアイドルなんて、セレブの中のセレブだよ。\nやっぱり、千鶴さんは特別なんだね！", "zh": "名流偶像，根本是名流中的名流了。\n我就知道，千鹤果然与众不同！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2013_038chz", "source_sha256": "7edc373278dcb68dfa81250e8abee213f54e512baeb72806663946b9e9c2f14e", "ja": "セレブの中の……セレブ……！", "zh": "名流中的……名流……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
