{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_038chz_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_038chz_001_2016_038chz", "source_sha256": "dc49aaf3c46fd39e28a5e0add68889c36782d33c6708b2187df876f40b144483", "ja": "そ、そうですわね！\n突然のことで、ちょっと驚いてしまいましたけど……。", "zh": "偶、偶像是吧！\n因为事出突然，本小姐才有些惊讶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
